# Output folder

Generated memos land here:

- `DRAFT_<slug>.docx` — the draft produced first. Always review this before
  anything is finalized; see the sign-off step in
  `.claude/skills/meeting-summary-memo/SKILL.md`.
- `FINAL_<slug>.docx` — only written after the operator explicitly accepts
  the draft's contents.

Generated files are not committed to source control (see `.gitignore`).
